30
00:00:51,154 --> 00:00:52,454
Gracias a su ingenio,

31
00:00:52,494 --> 00:00:53,961
su unión y su valentía,

32
00:00:54,261 --> 00:00:55,031
la humanidad

33
00:00:55,071 --> 00:00:56,151
